1
00:00:07,276 --> 00:00:13,900
The AFC Champions League Elite 2025-2026 resumes with eight teams from the West Zone in contention.
亚冠精英联赛2025-2026重燃战火 西区将有八支球队卷入争夺之中

2
00:00:13,941 --> 00:00:17,343
to secure a place in the quarterfinal of the centralized tournament.
他们只为在集中赛制的1/4决赛中占据一席之地

3
00:00:17,983 --> 00:00:25,567
With defending champions Al-Oli Saudi FC and former winners Al-Hilal, Essie,SFC, Al Sadis C and Al Etihad Club in the
卫冕冠军阿奥利沙特FC 以及前冠军阿尔希拉尔 埃西SFC 阿萨迪斯C 阿尔艾蒂哈德俱乐部同场混战

4
00:00:25,568 --> 00:00:25,767
mix,
局势愈发扑朔迷离

5
00:00:26,427 --> 00:00:30,669
the four single leg round of 16 ties are set to be blockbuster affairs.
接下来四场单回合16强对决注定会是场场重头戏

6
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:52,820
com previews the four tantalizing matchups.
比赛前瞻也为你奉上四组令人心动的对阵

7
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:56,422
Winners of the inaugural AFC Champions League Elite last season.
上赛季首届亚冠精英联赛的冠军

8
00:00:57,083 --> 00:01:02,707
Saudi Arabia's Al-Oli will be eyeing a similar run this time around after another prolific league stage campaign.
阿奥利这次同样瞄准类似的冲击 在又一段高产的联赛阶段征程之后

9
00:01:02,787 --> 00:01:05,188
where they finished second in the West Zone standings.
他们在西区积分榜上最终排名第2

10
00:01:05,809 --> 00:01:09,272
Matthias Jaisel's side suffered only one defeat in the eight matches,
马蒂亚斯·贾伊塞尔的球队在8场比赛里只遭遇1次失利

11
00:01:09,933 --> 00:01:15,940
winning five and drawing two to pick up 17 points.
赢下5场 2场打平 拿到17分

12
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:18,843
of Qatar, will be determined to provide a challenge
来自卡塔尔的这支队伍 也将誓要掀起挑战

13
00:01:18,884 --> 00:01:21,346
despite a seventh-place finish in the league stage.
尽管联赛阶段只排在第7位

14
00:01:22,708 --> 00:01:30,614
Campaign for the Jamal Belmody-led side, who advanced despite losing 3-2 to Araxal's shorter SC in their final league stage
由贾马尔·贝尔莫迪率领的球队在最后一轮联赛阶段虽以2-3不敌阿拉克斯尔短途SC 但仍挺进晋级

15
00:01:30,654 --> 00:01:30,915
match.
凭借那场比赛的结果

16
00:01:31,555 --> 00:01:38,000
Belmody, however, will draw confidence from the 2-2 stalemate against Al-Oli in the league stage
不过 贝尔莫迪将从联赛阶段对阵阿尔-奥利2-2的顽强战平中获得信心

17
00:01:38,020 --> 00:01:41,843
as they target a place in the last eight. For the first time since 2022,
当他们目标是跻身八强之际

18
00:01:42,504 --> 00:01:46,287
with Adil Boubina the joint tournament leading scorer with six goals,
这是自2022年以来的首次——

19
00:01:46,928 --> 00:01:50,230
just like they did in the 2024-2025 season.
而且阿迪尔·布拜纳以6球并列赛事头号射手

20
00:01:50,891 --> 00:01:54,614
Saudi Arabia's Al Hilal Al-Assad.LSFC were imperious in the league stage,
就像他们在2024-2025赛季那样

21
00:01:55,214 --> 00:01:57,296
topping the West zone with 22 points.
沙特阿拉伯的阿尔希拉尔·阿尔-阿萨德——LSFC在联赛阶段势不可挡

22
00:01:57,316 --> 00:02:02,480
with a goalless draw against UAE's Shabab Al-Oli being the only blip in an otherwise flawless run.
他们以22分力压西区

23
00:02:03,181 --> 00:02:07,724
Simone Nzoghi's first season at the club saw the four-time Asian champion sparkle
而与阿联酋沙巴布·阿尔-奥利0-0握手言和 几乎是他们完美之旅中唯一的瑕疵

24
00:02:07,784 --> 00:02:11,387
and secure their place in the knockout stage with three matches to spare.
西蒙妮·恩佐吉在加盟后的首个赛季让这支四度夺得亚冠的队伍闪耀生光

25
00:02:11,948 --> 00:02:14,990
Qatar's Al-Sad endured a tumultuous league stage campaign.
并在还剩三轮的情况下提前锁定淘汰赛席位

26
00:02:15,631 --> 00:02:19,274
with their spot in the round of 16 only secured on the final matchday
卡塔尔的阿尔-萨德经历了一段动荡不安的联赛征程

27
00:02:19,374 --> 00:02:22,616
thanks to Sharjah FC's 2 - 1 defeat to PFC Nassau.
他们进入16强的席位 直到最后一轮才最终敲定

28
00:02:23,357 --> 00:02:26,359
Having started their campaign with Felix Sanchez in charge,
全靠沙迦FC以2-1不敌PFC纳索

29
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:31,543
Italian Roberto Monchini has since taken over. But their recent form has not been good.
在费利克斯·桑切斯执教期间开启本届征程后

30
00:02:31,584 --> 00:02:34,045
and they will have to be at their best to deny Al-Hilal,
意大利人罗伯托·蒙钦随后接过教鞭 但他们近期状态并不理想

31
00:02:34,626 --> 00:02:37,008
who defeated them 3 - 2 in the league stage.
他们在联赛阶段以2-1击败了对手

32
00:02:37,648 --> 00:02:42,833
Islamic Republic of Iran's Traktor FC were the surprise package of the West Zone league stage.
伊朗伊斯兰共和国的特拉克托尔FC堪称西区联赛阶段的最大冷门

33
00:02:43,453 --> 00:02:46,816
Finishing third, level on 17 points with Al-Oli
他们以第三名收官 与阿尔-奥利同积17分

34
00:02:46,876 --> 00:02:50,279
as they sealed a round of 16 place with two matches to spare.
并在还剩两场的情况下就锁定了16强席位

35
00:02:50,819 --> 00:02:53,641
The ultra-tight defense they've had has been the bedrock of their campaign.
他们那种极为紧凑的防守 正是整个征程的根基

36
00:02:53,701 --> 00:02:58,966
with experienced goalkeeper Ole Reza Berimbang having kept a tournament leading five clean sheets.
经验丰富的门将奥莱·雷扎·贝里班明曾连续保持全场零封 整届赛事前五场都做到了零失球

37
00:02:59,686 --> 00:03:03,970
Shabab Al-Oli of the United Arab Emirates had a decent league stage campaign.
来自阿联酋的沙巴布·阿尔-奥利在联赛阶段表现也相当不错

38
00:03:04,590 --> 00:03:08,813
having won three matches and drawn two to finish in sixth spot on 11 points.
他们赢下3场 战平2场 最终以11分排名第六

39
00:03:09,454 --> 00:03:13,037
Paulo Souza's side relied on the goalscoring prowess of Bruno,
保罗·索萨的球队 主要依靠布鲁诺的进球能力

40
00:03:13,557 --> 00:03:17,100
who has four goals, and the silky skills of Guilherme Bola.
他个人有4球 还有古尔梅雷·博拉那手细腻的技术

41
00:03:17,681 --> 00:03:21,324
With both Brazilians capable of unlocking any defence on their day.
两名巴西人只要当天状态在线 就都有能力撕开任何防线

42
00:03:21,924 --> 00:03:25,227
It was a 1 - 1 draw when Traktor and Shabab met in the league stage,
特拉克托尔和沙巴布在联赛阶段交手时 双方战成1-1

43
00:03:25,267 --> 00:03:28,269
and this tie promises to be another evenly fought affair.
而这次对决也同样有望势均力敌

44
00:03:29,350 --> 00:03:32,993
Saudi Arabia's Al-Ittihad will be raring to go after five wins
沙特阿拉伯的阿尔-伊蒂哈德在豪取5场胜利之后士气正盛

45
00:03:33,053 --> 00:03:36,636
took them to a fourth place finish in the league stage on 15 points.
他们最终以15分收获联赛第四名

46
00:03:37,376 --> 00:03:40,379
Sergio Cancicao's arrival at the club sparked a revival
塞尔吉奥·坎塞考的加盟点燃了球队的复苏

47
00:03:40,419 --> 00:03:44,102
as they ended their league stage campaign strongly with three straight wins,
因为他们在联赛阶段后程强势收官 连胜三场

48
00:03:44,983 --> 00:03:46,884
scoring 12 goals in the process.
并在此过程中打进12球

49
00:03:47,605 --> 00:03:50,407
Leading their charge will be attacking midfielder Hausa Mawa,
在进攻端领衔的将是进攻型中场哈乌萨·马瓦

50
00:03:50,427 --> 00:03:55,231
who has six goals in his hand, while Moussa Diaby has five assists to his name.
他目前已收获6球 而穆萨·迪亚比则贡献了5次助攻

51
00:03:55,931 --> 00:04:00,375
UAE's Alwada FC only finished a rung lower and a point adrift of their opponents,
阿联酋的阿尔瓦达FC仅比对手低一名 并且少一分

52
00:04:00,955 --> 00:04:04,218
proving their capability with memorable wins along the way.
用一场场令人难忘的胜利证明了自己的实力

53
00:04:04,899 --> 00:04:08,481
One of those was the 2 - 1 success against Al-Ithihad on matchday one,
其中一场是在首轮2-1击败阿尔伊蒂哈德

54
00:04:08,522 --> 00:04:14,346
when Lucas Pimenta struck a last - gasp winner to give Darko Milani a fantastic start to their campaign.
卢卡斯·皮门塔在最后时刻打入制胜球 为达尔科·米兰尼的征程开了个绝佳头彩

55
00:04:14,927 --> 00:04:19,029
Revenge will be on the minds of Al-Ithihad as they seek a third continental title.
当阿尔伊蒂哈德力争拿下第三座洲际冠军时 复仇的念头势必在他们心中萦绕

56
00:04:19,610 --> 00:04:24,795
The AFC Champions League Elite 2025-2026 goes into hyperdrive
亚冠精英联赛2025-2026正式进入高强度模式

57
00:04:24,796 --> 00:04:29,798
as the West Zone's eight teams bid to stay in the hunt for the ultimate prize in Asian club football.
因为西区的8支球队将全力争取 守住通往亚洲俱乐部顶级荣誉的希望

58
00:04:29,898 --> 00:04:33,121
So expect plenty of thrills and spills from the four matches.
因此 接下来的四场比赛就别错过了精彩与刺激

59
00:04:33,841 --> 00:04:37,284
